- Products can be returned only in the country where purchased.
- For returns for cash or cash equivalent over $750, Apple will mail a refund check to you within 10 business days.
- For returns with a gift receipt, Apple will offer you an Apple Gift Card.
- For returns paid with your Apple Account balance, Apple will refund the portion paid to your Apple Account or, if unable, an Apple Gift Card.
- Returned products may require inspection. If approved, a refund or exchange will be issued within 10 business days.
- Apple provides security features to protect your product in case of loss or theft. If these features were activated and cannot be disabled by the person in possession, Apple may refuse the return or exchange.
